<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N =  2.56%				    O/N = 5.12%</p>
<p>	    T/N =  2.56%				    T/N = 5.12%</p>
<p>		   Oct 9, 1996			Oct 8, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  6.70%	1 month forward =  6.71%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  6.45%	2 month forward =  6.61%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  6.95%	3 month forward =  6.83%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  7.76%	4 month forward =  7.68%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  8.07%	5 month forward =  8.00%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  8.25%	6 month forward =  8.20%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
